  "description": "*\"Make a mess of me!\"* \n\nDo-Yoon, drunk and intoxicated by a broken heart, picks up a notebook with the words \\[Love Note\\] written on it while walking down the street. When he returns home, he begins to write down his fantasies about his unrequited love for Han-Gyeol, as if he were burning with desire. And then the next day, Han-Gyeol suddenly comes to his house??! \n\n*\"This is what I wrote in my notebook!!! If that's the case... then I can do more?\"*\n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated)\n\n*Note: Part of Peanutoon's Gosuwi BL Danpyeonseon (고수위 BL 단편선) Collection.*",
